//   drikPaksha   — Expected paksha (Shukla/Krishna)
//   drikSunrise  — Expected sunrise (HH:MM in local time)
//   drikSunset   — Expected sunset (HH:MM in local time)
//   toleranceMin — Allowed minutes drift for sunrise/sunset
//   notes        — Any known issues or edge cases
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

